{"The call to isConditionalPasskeysEnabled() omits the required UserModel argument - the method requires a UserModel parameter but is being called with no arguments, causing a compilation error": 0.9568999409675598, "isConditionalPasskeysEnabled returns false whenever context.getUser() is null, preventing webauthnAuth.fillContextForm(context) from executing during initial username/password challenge or error flows before user resolution, so passkeys stay unavailable in scenarios the change is supposed to fix": 0.6855324506759644, "Catching generic Exception around WebDriver lookup for WebAuthn form swallows unexpected runtime errors (timeouts, driver failures) and marks them as expected, making tests pass even when there is a real failure - should only catch NoSuchElementException": 0.9381234645843506, "Second try/catch checking for absence of WebAuthn form during re-authentication also catches generic Exception, masking unexpected WebDriver or test failures - should only catch NoSuchElementException": 0.902556300163269}